# `version` is updated by `cz bump` (Release PR workflow); do not edit it by hand.

cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use ArcaNN, please cite both the software (this record) and the
  accompanying paper listed under references.
type: software
title: "ArcaNN: automated enhanced sampling generation of training sets for chemically reactive machine learning interatomic potentials"
version: 1.0.0
license: AGPL-3.0-only
repository-code: "https://github.com/champagnn/arcann_training"
url: "https://champagnn.github.io/arcann_training/"
abstract: >-
  ArcaNN automates the iterative (active/concurrent learning) generation of
  training sets for reactive machine learning interatomic potentials such as
  DeePMD-kit and MACE: it trains a committee of models, explores phase space
  with enhanced-sampling molecular dynamics, selects configurations by query by
  committee, labels them, and retrains, while recording every parameter used.
keywords:
  - machine learning interatomic potentials
  - active learning
  - enhanced sampling
  - reactive chemistry
  - molecular dynamics
  - DeePMD-kit
  - MACE
